  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/create-better-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/kS90mr4y?color=34D058&amp;label=Modrinth%20%E4%B8%8B%E8%BC%89%E6%95%B8&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1108525?color=FC7303&amp;label=CurseForge%20%E4%B8%8B%E8%BC%89%E6%95%B8&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Reggarfgod/create_better_villagers?color=6E40C9&amp;label=%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E5%9B%9E%E5%A0%B1&amp;logo=github\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/CN962KMpJk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/430776550443581450?color=5865F2&amp;label=%E5%9C%A8%E7%B7%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B6&amp;logo=discord\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><a style=\"background-color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Lato, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: #e5e5e5;\" href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1010929/description_2dbdedf7-e1a0-4bcd-86a6-01c26447af70.png\"></strong></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>感謝我們的贊助商</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>感謝 ZAP-HOSTING！使用優惠碼 Reggarf-1047 可享任何訂單 20% 折扣！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9db24c00-7ce9-4c29-af58-e44c53e38af4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"493\" height=\"493\"></p>\n<div style=\"display: flex;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\">Create: Better Villager</span> 新增了一系列 Create 模組的村民職業 <img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0120b73c-046a-4b20-b605-562d6bff7358.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\"></strong></div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>功能列表</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">安山岩工匠</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;販售安山岩 Create 模組零件</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<pre style=\"text-align: center;\">工作台 - BASIN</pre>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_da38d869-08c8-4802-9661-9556b54df776.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"408\" height=\"408\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">黃銅工匠</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;販售黃銅 Create 模組零件</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<pre style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>工作台 - ROTATION_SPEED_CONTROLLER</strong></pre>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9a5dab7e-714a-438e-8975-0f9c0998d18e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"475\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #f1c40f;\"><strong>銅工匠</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;販售銅 Create 模組零件&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<pre style=\"text-align: center;\">工作台 - STEAM_ENGINE</pre>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5f749160-0cf1-4092-b1bc-24e489aceb86.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"416\" height=\"416\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">礦工</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>購買及販售安山岩、銅和黃銅的原始零件</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<pre style=\"text-align: center;\">工作台 - MECHANICAL_ARM</pre>\n</div>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_12d7c9e4-8f6e-4671-83c8-be482971af59.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"418\" height=\"418\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>模組評測影片</strong>&nbsp;</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zLU_LUCBQJY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">感謝 dejojotheawsome</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">為我們評測這個模組&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">請跳到 2:40 觀看 Create: Better villager 的評測部分&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>在 GitHub 或 Modrinth 上尋找 Create: Better Villager</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/createletscreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7186e4e2-24e8-4cfd-80c1-294cafaf58c9.gif\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>",
